;
; RT43 / PT43 (#740). No Tecnigrafo executable supplied expected values.
; Facade and flags: docs/tappe/0.8/PT43-contorni-dei-retini.md, points 2-5.
; PT43 point 2 excludes both block members and generated insert shapes.
; The four lines of the block must not leak into document candidates.

; PT9 refuses !block until PT16 implements block definitions. This existing
; behavior changes with PT16, independently of the two new PT43 questions.
; cambia con #693
!block "Frame" base=0,0
Bottom = LINE start=0,0 end=10,0
Right = LINE start=10,0 end=10,10
Top = LINE start=10,10 end=0,10
Left = LINE start=0,10 end=0,0
!endblock
I = INSERT block="Frame" insertion=0,0
? hatch-boundary 5,5 -> not-enclosed
? hatch-boundary 5,0 -> not-enclosed
? hatch-contours I -> left-out=I
